## Core Validation Rules Deployed (8)

1. `Nirmaan_Project__c.Actual_End_Requires_Actual_Start`: Actual End Date cannot be set without an Actual Start Date.
2. `Nirmaan_Project__c.End_Date_After_Start_Date`: Target End Date cannot precede Target Start Date.
3. `Pile__c.Concreting_Date_Requires_Boring_Complete`: Concreting date cannot be populated until boring is marked completed.
4. `Raft__c.Actual_Pour_Date_Not_Before_Target`: Actual pour date cannot precede scheduled target date.
5. `Daily_Progress_Log__c.Concrete_Pour_Requires_Volume`: Activity type Concreting requires non-zero poured volume.
6. `Daily_Progress_Log__c.DPR_Log_Date_Not_Future`: DPR date cannot be in the future.
7. `Inspection_Request__c.Defect_Remarks_Required_On_Rejection`: Rejection of inspection requires explicit defect remarks.
8. `Inspection_Request__c.Element_Lookup_Required_By_Type`: Inspecting a Pile, Raft, or Pedestal enforces populating the respective element lookup.

